OL,3,ADeath toll in Nigeria village raided by
OL,4,Agunmen rises to 48, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe death toll from Friday's attack on
OL,7,Fa remote village in the north-eastern
OL,8,FNigerian state of Taraba has risen to
OL,9,Fat least 48, police have told the BBC.
OL,11,FThe police had initially reported 10
OL,12,Fdeaths after unidentified gunmen on
OL,13,Fmotorcycles raided the village of
OL,14,FBinnari, looting shops and setting
OL,15,Fhouses ablaze.
OL,17,FMore bodies were discovered on Sunday,
OL,18,Faccording to state police spokesperson
OL,19,FVictor Mshelizah, who said some of the
OL,20,Fvictims had drowned while trying to
OL,21,Fescape the attackers while others were
OL,22,Fkilled in nearby bushes.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
