OL,3,ADeath toll in Nigeria village raided by
OL,4,Agunmen rises to 48, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, Amnesty International's
OL,7,Fdirector for Nigeria said his
OL,8,Forganisation had confirmed 52 deaths,
OL,9,Fciting sources on the ground and
OL,10,Fmembers of the local community.
